      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation-item",
      "description": "左对齐细线图标，软色底表示当前位置。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"写作练习\"><button class=\"ds-nav-item\" type=\"button\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m16 3 5 5-12 12-6 1 1-6Z\"/><path d=\"m14 5 5 5\"/></svg>审题与提纲</button><button class=\"ds-nav-item ds-nav-active\" type=\"button\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m16 3 5 5-12 12-6 1 1-6Z\"/><path d=\"m14 5 5 5\"/></svg>写作室</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;width:176px}.ds-nav-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;width:100%;text-align:left;padding:10px 12px;min-height:36px;border:0;border-radius:var(--r-sm,8px);background:transparent;color:var(--muted,#647080);font:13px/1.7 'Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei',-apple-system,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 180ms,color 180ms}.ds-nav-item svg{width:18px;height:18px;flex:none}.ds-nav-item:hover{background:var(--accent-bg,#EEF2F6);color:var(--ink,#202936)}.ds-nav-active,.ds-nav-active:hover{background:var(--primary-soft,#E8EEF4);color:var(--primary-dark,#294D73);font-weight:600}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--primary,#294D73);outline-offset:3px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){[class^=ds-]{transition:none;animation:none;scroll-behavior:auto}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "筛选标签",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "chip-selected",
      "description": "胶囊标签的未选与选中状态，使用实色强调底。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chip-row\"><button class=\"ds-chip\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">全部</button><button class=\"ds-chip ds-chip-selected\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">练习中</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chip-row{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.ds-chip{padding:5px 14px;min-height:36px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong,#BDC7D2);border-radius:999px;background:var(--card,#FFFFFF);color:var(--ink,#202936);font:13px/1.7 'Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei',-apple-system,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 180ms,border-color 180ms,color 180ms}.ds-chip:hover{border-color:var(--primary,#294D73);color:var(--primary,#294D73)}.ds-chip-selected,.ds-chip-selected:hover{background:var(--primary,#294D73);border-color:var(--primary,#294D73);color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:600}:host-context(.dark) .ds-chip-selected,:host-context(.dark) .ds-chip-selected:hover{color:#172432}.ds-chip:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--primary,#294D73);outline-offset:3px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){[class^=ds-]{transition:none;animation:none;scroll-behavior:auto}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "纸面卡片",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "常驻内容容器以细线和纸面区分层级，内部用分隔线。",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-card\"><h2 class=\"ds-card-title\">今日训练</h2><p class=\"ds-card-copy\">从本次题目继续独立作答。</p><div class=\"ds-card-section\"><button class=\"ds-card-action\" type=\"button\">继续草稿</button></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-card{padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--line,#DCE2E8);border-radius:var(--r-md,12px);background:var(--card,#FFFFFF);color:var(--ink,#202936);max-width:420px;box-shadow:none;font:14px/1.7 'Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei',-apple-system,sans-serif}.ds-card-title{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em}.ds-card-copy{color:var(--muted,#647080)}.ds-card-section{padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#DCE2E8)}.ds-card-action{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:36px;padding:9px 16px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong,#BDC7D2);border-radius:var(--r-sm,8px);background:var(--card,#FFFFFF);color:var(--ink,#202936);font:14px/1.7 'Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei',-apple-system,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 180ms,border-color 180ms,color 180ms}.ds-card-action:hover:not(:disabled){border-color:var(--primary,#294D73);color:var(--primary,#294D73)}.ds-card-action:active:not(:disabled){background:var(--accent-bg,#EEF2F6)}.ds-card-action:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:not-allowed}.ds-card-action:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--primary,#294D73);outline-offset:3px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){[class^=ds-]{transition:none;animation:none;scroll-behavior:auto}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "作文纸张",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "editor-sheet",
      "description": "连续英文作文的纸面编辑样本，外框承担聚焦反馈。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-editor-sheet\"><div class=\"ds-editor-label\"><label for=\"ds-essay\">我的作文</label><span>Task 2 · 自由分段</span></div><textarea class=\"ds-essay\" id=\"ds-essay\" rows=\"6\">Reliable public transport can reduce traffic congestion because one bus carries people who would otherwise drive separate cars.</textarea></section>",
      "css": ".ds-editor-sheet{padding:32px 40px;border:1px solid var(--line,#DCE2E8);border-radius:12px;background:var(--card,#FFFFFF);color:var(--ink,#202936);max-width:680px}.ds-editor-sheet:focus-within{border-color:var(--primary,#294D73)}.ds-editor-label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-bottom:18px;color:var(--muted,#647080);font:12px/1.7 'Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei',-apple-system,sans-serif}.ds-essay{width:100%;max-width:72ch;min-height:180px;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:0;background:var(--card,#FFFFFF);color:var(--ink,#202936);font:18px/1.8 Georgia,serif;resize:vertical;caret-color:var(--primary,#294D73)}.ds-essay:focus{outline:none}.ds-essay::selection{background:var(--primary-soft,#E8EEF4);color:var(--ink,#202936)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "可定位批注",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "annotation-mark",
      "description": "原文高亮和选中批注的静态样本；定位行为由实际应用提供。",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-annotation\"><p class=\"ds-original\">Public transport can <mark class=\"ds-mark\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看批注 1\">reduce traffic</mark> in cities.</p><div class=\"ds-annotation-selected\"><button class=\"ds-annotation-select\" type=\"button\">1. 说明因果关系</button><p class=\"ds-annotation-hint\">原文中 1 处</p></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-annotation{max-width:500px;color:var(--ink,#202936)}.ds-original{max-width:72ch;font:18px/1.8 Georgia,serif}.ds-mark{background:var(--warn-bg,#F7F2E9);color:var(--ink,#202936);border-bottom:1px solid var(--warn,#85602B);border-radius:2px;cursor:pointer;padding:1px 0}.ds-mark:hover,.ds-mark:focus-visible{background:var(--primary-soft,#E8EEF4);border-color:var(--primary,#294D73)}.ds-mark:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--primary,#294D73);outline-offset:3px}.ds-annotation-selected{background:var(--accent-bg,#EEF2F6);border-radius:8px;padding:14px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#DCE2E8)}.ds-annotation-select{display:block;text-align:left;min-height:28px;border:0;border-radius:0;background:transparent;padding:0;color:var(--ink,#202936);font:600 14px/1.7 'Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei',-apple-system,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-annotation-select:hover{color:var(--primary,#294D73)}.ds-annotation-select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--primary,#294D73);outline-offset:3px}.ds-annotation-hint{color:var(--muted,#647080);font:12px/1.8 'Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei',-apple-system,sans-serif;margin:8px 0}"
    },
    {
      "name": "正常流保存状态条",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "save-status",
      "description": "在正文之后显示字数、句数、计时与控制、保存文字和写作操作；此样本不执行计时或持久化。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-save-bar\"><span>总字数：76 / 250+</span><span>总句数：5</span><div class=\"ds-footer-timer\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"写作计时\"><div class=\"ds-timer-display\" role=\"timer\" aria-live=\"off\">40:00</div><div class=\"ds-timer-controls\"><button class=\"ds-save-action\" type=\"button\">开始</button><button class=\"ds-save-action\" type=\"button\">重置</button></div></div><span class=\"ds-save-status\" role=\"status\">已保存到本机</span><button class=\"ds-save-action\" type=\"button\">存草稿</button><button class=\"ds-save-action\" type=\"button\">复制全文</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-save-bar{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;position:static;padding:14px 18px;margin-top:12px;background:var(--card,#FFFFFF);color:var(--ink,#202936);border:1px solid var(--line,#DCE2E8);border-radius:12px;font:12px/1.7 'Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei',-apple-system,sans-serif;box-shadow:none}.ds-save-status{color:var(--muted,#647080)}.ds-save-status[data-state=error]{color:var(--bad,#A23F43)}.ds-save-action{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:36px;padding:9px 16px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong,#BDC7D2);border-radius:var(--r-sm,8px);background:var(--card,#FFFFFF);color:var(--ink,#202936);font:14px/1.7 'Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei',-apple-system,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 180ms,border-color 180ms,color 180ms}.ds-save-action:hover:not(:disabled){border-color:var(--primary,#294D73);color:var(--primary,#294D73)}.ds-save-action:active:not(:disabled){background:var(--accent-bg,#EEF2F6)}.ds-save-action:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:not-allowed}.ds-save-action:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--primary,#294D73);outline-offset:3px}.ds-save-action{min-height:32px;padding:5px 11px;font-size:13px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){[class^=ds-]{transition:none;animation:none;scroll-behavior:auto}}.ds-footer-timer{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;text-align:left;min-width:100px}.ds-timer-controls{display:flex;margin:0;gap:6px;flex-wrap:nowrap}.ds-timer-display{font-size:25px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:var(--ink,#202936);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}"
    },
    {
      "name": "资料搜索",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input-text",
      "description": "本地搜索与筛选；结果数量、清除和无结果提示相邻。明暗背景继承纸面色。",
      "html": "<label for=\"ds-search\">搜索范文</label><input id=\"ds-search\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"题目、范文或表达关键词\"><p role=\"status\">找到 12 篇范文</p>",
      "css": "input[type=\"search\"]{font:14px/1.7 \"Segoe UI\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--card);padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:8px}input[type=\"search\"]:focus{border-color:var(--primary);outline:2px solid var(--primary-soft);outline-offset:1px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "安静、精密的写作工作台",
    "overview": "安静、精密的写作工作台。界面退后、内容向前：雾灰工作区衬托纸面式编辑区，墨色承载正文，深蓝标记操作与定位。系统 UI 字体组织中文界面，Georgia 承载英文作文与参考文本。\n\n密度服务持续写作、阅读反馈与改写。细线分隔、克制圆角和色调层次建立秩序；保存与反馈状态用明确文字呈现，可定位批注把问题与原句连接起来。此文是对已确认方向和当前实现的刷新，数值以 frontmatter 与现有 CSS 为准。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "雾灰、纸白、墨色与深蓝组成工作环境。",
      "系统 UI 字体与 Georgia 分担界面和英文阅读。",
      "平面容器、细线分隔、可见焦点与真实状态。",
      "桌面正文与辅助栏并行，允许手动收起辅助栏。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The One Accent Rule",
        "body": "深蓝承担操作和选中强调；成功、警告与错误色只表达对应状态，不承担装饰。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Essay First Rule",
        "body": "界面文字使用系统无衬线字体，连续作文与诊断原稿使用 Georgia；正文可读性优先于界面装饰。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Explicit Panel Rule",
        "body": "教学面板由用户手动切换；不要把现有桌面布局描述为自动收起面板。",
        "section": "layout"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Surface Rule",
        "body": "常驻卡片与编辑纸张用边框和色调区分层级，不通过彩色发光或悬停抬升制造深度。",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Visible State Rule",
        "body": "保存中、保存成功、保存失败与旧版反馈必须使用可见文字；不要只依赖颜色。",
        "section": "components"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do 沿用已确认的雾灰、纸白、墨色和深蓝，以及对应深色主题。",
      "Do 为中文界面使用系统 UI 字体，为连续英文作文与诊断原稿使用 Georgia。",
      "Do 保持可见键盘焦点，并用文字说明保存、错误和反馈版本状态。",
      "Do 用细线分隔容器内部内容，并保留用户手动收起教学面板的控制。",
      "Do 在本次桌面验收范围（1280 / 1440 / 1600px）分别复核布局、明暗主题和交互。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't 添加装饰性 emoji、大面积渐变、紫色装饰或彩色发光阴影。",
      "Don't 用新的卡片边框和投影反复套住已有卡片内部内容。",
      "Don't 以阻塞式 alert/confirm 替代现有通知和原生确认对话框。",
      "Don't 把保存状态条写成固定或吸底控件，也不要声称面板会自动收起。",
      "Don't 将桌面验收推广为移动端设计保证，或声称未经逐项证明的完整 WCAG AA 合规。"
    ]
  }
}
